{
  "id": "JOS.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "JOS",
  "reference": "Yoshua 18",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ense entigari egwatananwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli babuete ense eria, omoganda obo bwonsi ogasangererekana agwo Silo, na agwo bagatenenia Eema y’Omosangererekano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ebisaku bitano na bibere mbiatigarete bitatananeretwe ensemo y’ense ebe omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Yoshua agateebia Abaisraeli, “Inee! Ngoika ririri moratebaane kogenda koira ense eye Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaino, abaeire?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchorere abanto batato korwa ase kera egesaku, na inche nimbatome bataare ase ense engima, bayiate na kworokia ase okorika chinsemo chigwenerete koba omwando bwa kera egesaku. Erio bandetere amang’ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense yatananwe ase chinsemo isano na ibere. Abayuda nigo baragenderere komenya ase orogongo rwabo agwo ensemo ya Irianyi, na Abayusufu ase orwabo, ensemo ya sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morike mworokie omooroberio oyio bw’ogwaterana ense ase chinsemo isano na ibere, moyorente ase ’nde, na inche nimbaakere obomera ase okobori’Omonene, Nyasae oito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi barabwo tibakoegwa egetari gi’ense amo nainwe, ekiagera egetari kiabo nokomokorera Omonene ase emeremo y’obokuani. Egesaku kia Gadi, na ekia Rubeni na ekeng’ese ki’egesaku kia Manase barabwo konya baeirwe omwando obo moocha ya Yorodani, omwando oria Musa, omosomba Omonene, abaatananerete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba bakagenda gwata ense buna Yoshua abachiigete na kobateebereria, “Genda motaare ase ense engima, mworokie ase okorika buna ense eyio ere. Erio moirane ase ’nde, na inche nimbaakere obomera ase okobori’Omonene aiga Silo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono abanto abwo bakagenda, bagaetanana ense eria engima, bakarika ase okworokia buna bayiatete ense ase chinsemo isano na ibere kobwatekana nemechie yonsi. Erio bakairana ase Yoshua ase egetwori agwo Silo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akabaakera obomera ase okobori’Omonene aria Silo, agaatananera Abaisraeli ense eyio, kera egesaku ensemo yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orogongo rw’egesaku kia Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obomera bw’eritang’ani bokagwera chiamate chi’egesaku kia Benjamini. Orogongo rwabo rokaba egati y’orogongo rw’egesaku kia Yuda na orw’ekia Yusufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo ya sugusu orobebe rwabo rogaachakera orooche rwa Yorodani, rogatiira gochia egetirimboko sugusu ya Yeriko, naende gochia bosongo goetera ense y’ebitunwa, rogaika erooro ya Beti‐Aveni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na korwa aroro rokagenderera goika ebitirimboko bia Lusu (noro Beteli), rogatirimboka goika Ataroti Adari ase egetunwa kere, Irianyi ya Beti‐Horoni maate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orobebe rokagenderera na rokaonchoka gochia Irianyi, bosongo y’egetunwa keria kerochie Beti‐Horoni, rogaika Kiriati‐Baali (noro Kiriati‐Yearimu), omochie bw’egesaku kia Yuda. Oro nigo rwarenge orobebe rwabo rwa bosongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orobebe rwa Irianyi nigo rwachakerete ensinyo ya Kiriati‐Yearimu, rokagenderera gochia ensemo ya bosongo, rogaika ase chinsoko chia Nefitoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa agwo rogatirimboka rogaika ensinyo y’egetunwa kerochie Rikura ria Beni‐Hinomu, rire ensemo ya sugusu y’ense omweremo ya Refaimu. Erio rokagenda gochia Irianyi goetera Rikura ria Hinomu, Irianyi y’esagamo y’Abayebusi gochia Eni‐Rogeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende rokagenderera gochia sugusu rogaika Eni‐Semesi, naende goika Geliloti kororia egetirimboko ki’Adumimi. Erio rogatirimboka gochia Rigena ria Bohani, mosinto o Rubeni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rogaeta sugusu y’esagamo ere igoro y’Ekerubo Ekiomo, naende rogatirimboka goika Ekerubo keria Ekiomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa agwo orobebe rokagenderera gochia esagamo ya Beti‐Hogila, rogaika ensemo ya sugusu y’Enyancha y’omonyoo ase orooche rwa Yorodani ronuchete. Oro narwo orobebe rwa Irianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yorodani narwo orobebe rwa moocha. Echio nachio chimbebe chiaetanaine orogongo orwo chiamate chi’egesaku kia Benjamini chianyorete rokaba omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emechie ye chiamate chi’egesaku kia Benjamini nigo yarenge: Yeriko, na Beti‐Hogila, na Emeki‐Kesisi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Beti‐Araba, na Semaraimu, na Beteli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Avimu, na Para, na Ofura,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Kefari‐Amoni, na Ofuni, na Geba, emechie ikomi na ebere, amo nebichie biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende yarenge Gibeoni, na Rama, na Beroti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Misipa, na Kefira, na Mosa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Rekemu, na Iripeli, na Tarala,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Zela, na Elefu, na Yebusi (noro Yerusalemu), na Gibea, na Kiriati‐Yearimu, emechie ikomi na ene, amo nebichie biabo. Oyo noro orenge omwando bwe chiamate chi’egesaku kia Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
